flowchart TB
    F[feature/igate-step3-citizen-email] --> PRD[PR to dev]
    PRD --> C1[CI: lint, test, security, build]
    C1 --> D[dev integration]
    D --> U[staging and UAT]
    U --> PRP[Promotion PR to canonical main/master]
    PRP --> C2[Required checks and review]
    C2 --> T[Immutable release tag and artifact digest]
    T --> P[Production deployment]
    P --> V[Smoke tests and metrics]
    V -->|healthy| DONE[Release complete]
    V -->|unhealthy| RB[Rollback or disable flag]
